  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 12, 'Workflow H: resolve duplicate vaccination events business process'. Two lanes: PCPOSS, and vaccination location health worker or system administrator. The PCPOSS does 1. identify groups of vaccination events for evaluation; the person does 2. evaluate vaccination event records and decides 3. duplicate events? No ends the process; yes leads to 4. select the most accurate/suitable event record, then the PCPOSS does 5. update vaccination event records and 6. generate report of duplicate vaccination events, and the process ends.",
